<title>SOUTH AFRICA: De Beers to list on Namibian bourse Thurs.</title>
<headline>De Beers to list on Namibian bourse Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some 380.21 million linked units in diamond giant De Beers Consolidated Mines Ltd and De Beers Centenary AG are to be listed on the Namibian Stock Exchange (NSE) on Thursday, the companies said.</p>
<p>They said they applied for an NSE listing to demonstrate their commitement to the development of Namibia and its economy.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
